   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "Noted — the first one's cut goes on your list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: Different shapes, everything else matched. I'd leave the second one.",
   "images": [
    "pink/solid_polo_shirt.jpg",
